     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_-1347085231784474330__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Sergio,<u></u><u></u></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">That option is not in geomorph. However, Anjali’s paleomorph package will allow one to calculate the p x p landmark covariance matrix as in her 2006 paper, using\r\n the function dotcvm.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><br>\r\nDean<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">       Department of Statistics</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486146910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1B8ZVOeWPLtpAZmg5yCdbL\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
