     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Sergio Ferreira Cardoso<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, May 18, 2017 9:13 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] Determine modules in 3-dimensional data<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nDear all,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI&#39;m working on a set of skulls and I wish to find out to each modules my landmarks should be assigned and also how many modules exist. I&#39;ve searched in the Geomorph 3.0 files but all methods I find require a modules known\r\n<i>a priori</i>, which allow me to test hypothesis but not to find out which landmarks are more correlated to each other. I found the function\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">define</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">modules</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">the closest to what I wish to do, but still it requires\r\n<i>a priori</i> known modules. My question is: is there any way to determine modules with Geomorph?<br>\r\n<br>\r\nI checked on the methodology of  Goswami, A. (2006), which appears to be the most straightforward way to determine modules.However, one of the products of gpagen is the vaeiance-covariance matrix of coordinates. Is there a way to obtain the variance-covariance\r\n matrix of landmarks, do that in order to then be able to do something like this (see below), to find the most correlated landmarks?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">data</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">gpa\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">&lt;-</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> gpagen</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#660066\">Landma</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#000088\">print</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">progress\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> FALSE</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid #bbbbbb 1.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt;background:#fafafa\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">d\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">&lt;-</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> dist</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">data</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">gpa$points</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">.</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">VCV</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">\r\n method </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#008800\">&quot;euclidean&quot;</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><br>\r\n<span>fit</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">&lt;-</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">hclust</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">(</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">d</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">method</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">=</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#008800\">&quot;ward.D&quot;</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">)</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nThank you, in advance, for your attention.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
